    "Scan of the 1959 edition of the Acton, California, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1974; field checked in 1959; photo inspected in 1991; photo revised in 1974; last revised in 1994; printed in 1994.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22.3 x 27.2 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
